{"name": "Indies' Lies 2: Fire Seed", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/bb2a9df564f30dd2e61ab277c352cd14.poster.avif?t=1762930608\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/bb2a9df564f30dd2e61ab277c352cd14.webm?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/bb2a9df564f30dd2e61ab277c352cd14.mp4?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Indies' Lies 2: Fire Seed</strong> is a top-down 2D tactical Roguelite where you command a trio of heroes, forging legends on an ever-shifting battlefield. This fusion of \u200b<strong>\u200bhardcore strategy\u200b</strong>\u200b and \u200b<strong>\u200bdeep Roguelite progression\u200b</strong>\u200b delivers a relentless cycle: \u200b<strong>\u200btactical planning \u2192 explosive power spikes \u2192 cathartic enemy annihilation\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the sequel to the classic Roguelike card game <i>Indies\u2019 Lie</i>, this installment continues the saga: Under the shadow of the evil god Indies, the Lady of Death awakens warriors across time. Lead your faction through procedurally generated battles and confront divine tyranny on the volatile continent of Meka!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u258dDynamic Squad Building\u200b</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/f644b5469ceb3beaaefef8c1585300e5.poster.avif?t=1762930608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/f644b5469ceb3beaaefef8c1585300e5.webm?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/f644b5469ceb3beaaefef8c1585300e5.mp4?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a 3-member squad from \u200b<strong>\u200bmechanically diverse characters\u200b</strong>\u200b, each with \u200b<strong>\u200bexclusive Kindling abilities, equipment, relics, and battlefield roles\u200b</strong>\u200b. Melee charges, ranged snipes, crowd control\u2014every team composition unlocks endless tactical possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200b\u258dUnpredictable Roguelite Challenges\u200b</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/87dae453cd834a70178567998af08f26.poster.avif?t=1762930608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/87dae453cd834a70178567998af08f26.webm?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/87dae453cd834a70178567998af08f26.mp4?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each expedition features \u200b<strong>\u200brandomized maps, enemies, and events\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014elite ambushes, sudden disasters, cryptic altars. Unlock \u200b<strong>\u200bhundreds of equipment and Kindling combos\u200b</strong>\u200b to craft earth-shattering synergies. Will you focus on single-target nukes or AoE domination? The choice defines your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200b\u258dTactical Chessboard Warfare\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/bdbde478263d8ea1661e17e72223b730.poster.avif?t=1762930608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/bdbde478263d8ea1661e17e72223b730.webm?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/bdbde478263d8ea1661e17e72223b730.mp4?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Terrain as Weapon\u200b</strong>\u200b: Split enemy forces with obstacles, bait bosses into attacking their own minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Synergy Chains\u200b</strong>\u200b: Qili\u2019s \u200b<strong>\u200bposition-resetting combos\u200b</strong>\u200b, Diego\u2019s \u200b<strong>\u200bcounter-trap ambushes\u200b</strong>\u200b, Daniel\u2019s \u200b<strong>\u200bstatus-spreading explosions\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014every action breeds lethal potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Threat Priorities\u200b</strong>\u200b: Execute healers first? Interrupt charging elites? Every turn demands life-or-death decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u258dFreeform Build System\u200b</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/d0f2a0ab30db778341d4b4bc72d2e8ef.poster.avif?t=1762930608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/d0f2a0ab30db778341d4b4bc72d2e8ef.webm?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/extras/d0f2a0ab30db778341d4b4bc72d2e8ef.mp4?t=1762930608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix \u200b<strong>\u200b112 tactical components\u200b</strong>\u200b: 12 hero-exclusive relics \u00d7 9 game-breaking equipment \u00d7 7 high-risk Burning Kindling effects. Craft builds like \u200b<strong>\u200bBlink Crit\u200b</strong>\u200b, \u200b<strong>\u200bCounter Tank\u200b</strong>\u200b, or \u200b<strong>\u200bToxin Overload\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014your creativity is the ultimate weapon.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Indies' Lies 2: Fire Seed\u200b\u200b is a top-down 2D roguelite tactics game. Command three heroes in chess-like battles, forging legends through terrain strategy, skill combos, and ever-evolving rogue builds on a dynamic battlefield.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670960/8755e4c3b2c80e1ba60dc9dbc45e8f9c99a1f7e9/header.jpg?t=1762930608", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Turn-Based Combat", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelike"], "developers": "Fun Square Games", "publishers": "Fun Square Games", "release_date": "Nov 11, 2025", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "2670960", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 June 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/dv7a7HEIiSM", "first_seen": 1749420000.0, "review_rank": 1584}